{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"pug","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Pug","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Pug (.pug .jade).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"pug","name":"Pug","extensions":[".pug",".jade"],"grammar":"grammars/pug.json","lineComment":"//"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Pug","path":"snippets/pug.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/pug.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[a-z][a-z0-9-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[.#][A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z-]+(?==)\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[+][A-Za-z_]+\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#\\\\{[^}]*\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:default|include|extends|unless|while|block|mixin|else|each|case|when|for|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/pug.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Page skeleton\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"doc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"doctype html\",\n      \"html(lang=\\\"${1:en}\\\")\",\n      \"\\thead\",\n      \"\\t\\ttitle ${2:Title}\",\n      \"\\tbody\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A page\"\n  },\n  \"Each\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"each\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"each ${1:item} in ${2:items}\",\n      \"\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"each\"\n  },\n  \"Mixin\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mixin\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"mixin ${1:name}(${2:args})\",\n      \"\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A mixin\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Pug\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Pug.\n\n## Files\n\n`.pug`, `.jade`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `doc` | A page |\n| `each` | each |\n| `mixin` | A mixin |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}